Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.01,0:00:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.51,0:00:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold the rock fragments in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.21,0:00:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If they deem you worthy of their\Npower, you'll be able to grasp them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.01,0:00:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, and\Nwelcome to our family.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.77,0:00:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta go straight to the source, and\Ndestroy that secret weapon of theirs!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.27,0:00:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,They're one step ahead of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.19,0:00:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.69,0:00:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The ruins may have been destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.87,0:00:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,but there are copies of the\Ninscriptions at a museum.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.59,0:00:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in Florida.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.77,0:00:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll book our flights, and we'll\Ntake a train to the airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.93,0:00:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Deliver to me the soul of the pharaoh\Nand his companion, young Joseph Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.85,0:00:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The Oricalcos is with you. Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.87,0:01:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.63,0:01:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.85,0:02:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to do. Do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.83,0:02:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,How long is this train\Nride anyway? How long? Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.41,0:02:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Any chance you want to\Ngo instead of me, Duke?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.25,0:02:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,No can do, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.71,0:03:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta stick with Professor Hawkins\Nin case those biker punks come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.41,0:03:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Duke's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.37,0:03:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, he's gotta keep\Nan eye on Rebecca, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.33,0:03:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna go, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.07,0:03:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,They need a brain like mine to\Nfigure out how to save Yu-Gi! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.31,0:03:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous, and the Pharaoh\Nhas enough on his mind already.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.65,0:03:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The last thing he needs is the\Nresponsibility of looking after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.39,0:03:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,His closest friend in the\Nworld's been taken from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.35,0:03:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't understand anything,\NGrandpa! Rebecca, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.07,0:03:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's for your own good!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.69,0:03:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You better get on before\Nyou miss your ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.49,0:03:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We got plenty of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.25,0:03:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.53,0:03:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I said, all aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.71,0:03:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care, Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.29,0:03:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Smell you later, Devlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.33,0:04:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's hit the dining car\NNow you're talking my language
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.49,0:04:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing like cold soda, a\Nbag of chips and good friends
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.49,0:04:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,He's barely said a word all day.\NI gotta get him to say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.81,0:04:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, the view is awesome.\NCome on, check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.29,0:04:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Florida has the best beaches Oh man, I\Nthink I forgot to pack my bathing suit
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.81,0:04:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The pharaoh must really miss Yugi I guess
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.47,0:04:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,it's like a part of\Nhimself is missing The fun,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.91,0:04:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,carefree side
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.73,0:04:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I miss him too
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.09,0:04:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you gotta cheer\Nup. I promise we'll get
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.33,0:05:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,yuki back but in the\Nmeantime you can't just
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.33,0:05:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,sit around moping it\Nmight feel better to talk
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.57,0:05:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,about it we can even come\Nup with a plan together
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.33,0:05:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,sorry tear poor guy
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.09,0:05:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he needs to be\Nalone for a while, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.99,0:05:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He's already alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.69,0:05:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that the whole problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.57,0:05:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He's crushed, but he'll be\Ngood as new soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.79,0:05:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Because we're going to\Nrescue Yugi, right guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.03,0:05:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.05,0:05:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I have been so selfish?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.53,0:05:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave into the darkness within my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.51,0:05:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And Yugi paid the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.85,0:05:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,For my next sacrifice, I choose my
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.21,0:05:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,useless dark magician girl fire catapult
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.93,0:06:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,you let your rage take over now\Nlook into the eyes of your monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.51,0:06:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,please forgive me for\Nwhat i've done to you it's
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.45,0:06:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,too late now so say goodbye\Nto your soul pharaoh Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.59,0:06:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Guardian Iatos.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.09,0:06:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,destroy his monsters and\Nthe rest of his life points!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.09,0:06:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to seal you away forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.09,0:06:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.81,0:06:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.41,0:06:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It only needs one of us, so I'm\Nletting the seal take me instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.43,0:06:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.61,0:06:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I've lost him forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.89,0:07:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been gone for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.35,0:07:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.69,0:07:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not the only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.91,0:07:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Call me crazy,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.47,0:07:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,but wasn't this train completely filled\Nwith passengers just a minute ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.57,0:07:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.77,0:07:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How can a train full of people\Nall of a sudden be empty? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.83,0:07:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, now I'm officially freaked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.67,0:07:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,A vacant train is the least of\Nyour problems, my young friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.39,0:07:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just getting warmed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.21,0:07:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone in there, Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.25,0:07:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.03,0:07:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have to say soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.21,0:07:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a complete ghost town in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.67,0:08:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say ghost either.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.37,0:08:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.93,0:08:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,In case you haven't noticed,\Nsomething weird's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.43,0:08:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If you ask me, I'd say this\Nwhole train ride is another trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.55,0:08:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure those same slime\Nballs are behind this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.75,0:08:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And I bet they're on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.57,0:08:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what are we standing here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.43,0:08:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.29,0:08:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.57,0:08:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab my hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.51,0:08:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh, Taya!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.91,0:08:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.35,0:08:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Get help!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.27,0:09:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we have to find\Na way to stop this train!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.13,0:09:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, we're slowing down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.65,0:09:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard him, we gotta get help!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.31,0:09:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, but there's a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.93,0:09:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in the middle of nowhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.47,0:09:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,and we don't even know where\Nthose two are going to end up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.85,0:09:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye, guys. Hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.31,0:09:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess it's just you and me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.23,0:09:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Rex?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.14,0:09:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.73,0:09:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have a score to\Nsettle with you, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.87,0:09:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.79,0:09:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You took my red-eyes black dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.11,0:09:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Rex, this is not the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.03,0:09:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the perfect time for revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.77,0:09:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Conductor?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.43,0:09:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone there? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.59,0:09:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.55,0:10:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to get in there so I\Ncan stop this train. But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.35,0:10:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I have an idea. There may be an\Nemergency hatch on the roof. Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.15,0:10:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Weevil Underwood
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.81,0:10:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you behind this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.79,0:10:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd better start explaining yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.19,0:10:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Weevil, what do you\Nwant with us, worm boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.85,0:10:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think I want?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.57,0:10:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,A rematch with the king\Nof games Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.11,0:10:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just in the mood for a friendly\Nduel Weevil, who put you up to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.69,0:10:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No one did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.25,0:10:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I figured this was a good time to test\Nout my new secret weapon, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.13,0:10:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that magic rock the\Nprofessor told us about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.13,0:10:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd you find that thing, Raptor?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.35,0:10:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.53,0:10:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He's working for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.67,0:10:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been brainwashed, Weevil!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.95,0:10:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.07,0:11:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Those guys are just using you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.85,0:11:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.43,0:11:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I have ultimate\Npower! You're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.99,0:11:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Then just duel me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.19,0:11:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.23,0:11:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.53,0:11:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous! Weevil,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.85,0:11:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,don't you realize that if you\Ngo through with this duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.55,0:11:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,one of you guys is gonna lose\Nyour soul forever? Taya...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.99,0:11:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.31,0:11:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the whole reason I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.39,0:11:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,To make him pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.03,0:11:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,By sealing him away! No! Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.03,0:11:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon you'll be locked away\Nwith your friend Yugi, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.51,0:11:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he? Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.03,0:11:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid the only way\Nto find out is to duel me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.29,0:11:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you back down now, then you'll\Nnever see that little twerp again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.37,0:11:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well. Then let's duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.53,0:11:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Wise choice, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.43,0:11:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna enjoy this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.59,0:11:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd you do to my friends? Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.35,0:12:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Weevil's dealing with those losers\Nwhile I handle you two. Weevil?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.57,0:12:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So he's in on this thing, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.67,0:12:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Rex, you guys picked the wrong\Nside to join. Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.71,0:12:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we'll just see about that, won't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.69,0:12:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been given more power\Nthan you ever dreamed of.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.33,0:12:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Rex,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.53,0:12:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,not only can I duel circles around your\Nsorry behind, but you're half my size.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.57,0:12:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So why don't you get out of\Nmy way before I step on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.73,0:12:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.11,0:12:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going anywhere till we duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.49,0:12:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So draw your cards and\Nlet's get it on, chump.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.33,0:12:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a duel to win. Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.57,0:12:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I warned him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.05,0:12:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's trample this geek\Nand then go find Yugi and Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.15,0:12:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Good call. Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.85,0:12:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll change your mind\Nwhen I activate this card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.29,0:12:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Look familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.89,0:12:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The seal of Ori Calcos.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.03,0:12:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Drop the card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.33,0:12:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing's evil, Rex.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.69,0:12:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, you have\Nno idea what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.79,0:13:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not so tough now, are you, Wheeler?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.49,0:13:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He played it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.33,0:13:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Tristan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.87,0:13:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, that's what I call power.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.21,0:13:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What was he thinking playing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.63,0:13:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.05,0:13:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He just raised the stakes\Non this duel big time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.09,0:13:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Now whoever loses the\Ngame loses their soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.83,0:13:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Gee, thanks for the reminder.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.59,0:13:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.71,0:13:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's payback time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.53,0:13:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Rex.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.21,0:13:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.99,0:13:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have much choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.73,0:13:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I've improved since our last duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.17,0:13:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But you'll see that for\Nyourself soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.29,0:13:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.15,0:14:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back in the train, Taya. But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.03,0:14:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous up here, and\Nthere's no telling what Weevil will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.11,0:14:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't keep you in suspense any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.35,0:14:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my move, and I think I'll\Nplay the Seal of Orycalcos.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.23,0:14:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Weevil, don't be a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.15,0:14:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What seems to be the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.35,0:14:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You've played this card\Nbefore, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.17,0:14:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm not mistaken, this is what\Nyou use to lock little Yugi away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.29,0:14:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.79,0:14:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.53,0:14:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to experience this\Ncard's power firsthand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.71,0:14:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And when you lose, you'll\Njoin your little friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.73,0:14:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Weevil, if you activate that card,\Nyou're putting yourself in danger also.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.59,0:14:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the advice, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.61,0:14:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But who asked?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.69,0:14:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.75,0:15:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Tia!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.55,0:15:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.51,0:15:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.93,0:15:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.07,0:15:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.99,0:15:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.17,0:15:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like the battles are underway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.55,0:15:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, master.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.83,0:15:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And if all goes well, the soul of\Nthe pharaoh will soon be yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.09,0:15:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, we win no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.87,0:15:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Because whatever the final\Noutcome is, we get two souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.25,0:15:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I challenged you,\NI'll start things off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.91,0:15:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll play my good\Nfriend, pheromone wasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.13,0:15:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not strong now,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.97,0:15:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,but the power of the Seal of\NAurichalcos gives it a 500-point boost.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.53,0:16:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll place two cards\Nface-down and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.09,0:16:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.55,0:16:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,My move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.83,0:16:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Obnoxious Celtic Guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.73,0:16:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,A stronger monster than yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.67,0:16:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He better not attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.45,0:16:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Weevil has two face-down\Ncards! Hold on! Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.61,0:16:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Celtic Guardian!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.05,0:16:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Crush his pheromone wasp now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.15,0:16:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.01,0:16:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You just activated my trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.29,0:16:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,A handy little card called Mimesis!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.27,0:16:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.55,0:16:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.46,0:16:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It allows me to trade in my\Ninsect monster for another one!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.05,0:16:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So I get to choose which monster your\Nobnoxious Celtic Guardian attacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.43,0:16:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And now my pheromone\Nwasp, return to my hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.83,0:16:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And my parasite caterpillar\Nwill take its place!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.39,0:16:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.30,0:16:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It has the power to infect my monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.17,0:17:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You're absolutely right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.13,0:17:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Your guardian's been infected!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.09,0:17:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.09,0:17:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You're only half the duelist, I remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.51,0:17:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that because you lost your other half?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.35,0:17:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to duel, Wheeler?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.25,0:17:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Or just stand there like a\Nloser while I take you apart?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.15,0:17:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I got no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.25,0:17:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I didn't want to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.53,0:17:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But you got yourself a duel. Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.87,0:17:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only way to save\Nyou, so yes. Good answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.19,0:17:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for\Nthis moment for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.23,0:17:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,As much as I hate this little runt,\NI can't let the Orycalcos take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.77,0:17:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No one deserves that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.11,0:17:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, before my turn\Nbegins, I can play this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.37,0:17:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.39,0:17:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Before your turn begins?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.87,0:17:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.78,0:18:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If I have a Gilosaurus in my hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.93,0:18:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,it automatically jumps to the\Nfield before I make my move!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.33,0:18:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And I've got two!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.83,0:18:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So you'll have to deal\Nwith double the dino now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.63,0:18:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not off to a great start.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.67,0:18:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.17,0:18:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not finished yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.93,0:18:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Kai-tau-terra.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.29,0:18:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.31,0:18:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's already got three monsters\Non the field, and I've got Zip.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.15,0:18:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, the seal of Orichalcos makes\Nmy three dinosaurs even stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.85,0:18:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it, you just lucked\Nout by getting dealt a good opening hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.43,0:18:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But you can't win a duel with just luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.57,0:18:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.59,0:18:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You only beat me last time\Nbecause you got lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.59,0:18:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.01,0:18:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You know he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.95,0:18:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, whose side are you on anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.07,0:18:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Just telling it like it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.93,0:18:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll take it easy on you for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.43,0:18:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,and finish up by placing\None card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.99,0:18:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's see what you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.07,0:19:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I only have one monster in my hand\Nthat can stand up to his lizards.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.53,0:19:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Panther Warrior, and\NI'll put him in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.83,0:19:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The only problem is,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.61,0:19:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,my Panther Warrior can't attack unless\NI sacrifice another monster first.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.53,0:19:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's see what I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.61,0:19:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My scapegoats will do the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.17,0:19:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'll place one card\Nface down and then end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.95,0:19:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This next in section looks familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.71,0:19:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Cerebone Wasp!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.57,0:19:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,My only monster has been infected\Nby his parasite caterpillar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.71,0:19:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That means it's no longer\Nable to defend my life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.91,0:19:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, my pheromone wasp!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.01,0:19:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.43,0:19:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.11,0:20:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Attacking you directly just\Nactivated his special ability,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.81,0:20:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,which means my wasp\Nallows me to summon any
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.43,0:20:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,insect monster in my deck\Ndirectly to the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.57,0:20:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I know just who I'm going to choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.17,0:20:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon a leech known as Legul!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.03,0:20:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll activate the\NMagic card, Insect Barrier!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.13,0:20:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This barricade provides\Nthe perfect protection
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.97,0:20:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,against any insect monster\Nyou try and attack with!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.77,0:20:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.89,0:20:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.55,0:20:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have any insect\Nmonsters in your deck?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.55,0:20:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.99,0:20:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a closer look at the field, Taya!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.79,0:20:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Celtic Guardian's been\Ncontaminated by my parasite,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.57,0:20:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,which makes him part insect! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.49,0:20:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He's slowly transforming into a new\Ncreature known as Poison Butterfly!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.65,0:21:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And even though it has\N2,700 attack points,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.77,0:21:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,it can't hurt me thanks\Nto my insect barrier!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.97,0:21:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And since it can't attack or\Ndefend, it's virtually useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.63,0:21:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Weevil is a much stronger\Nduelist than I remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.61,0:21:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,now that he's infused with\Nthe power of the Ori Kalkos.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.97,0:21:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He seems unstoppable, but I refuse to let\Nhim stand in the way of rescuing Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.07,0:21:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, my move!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.65,0:21:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be long now. The soul of the
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.11,0:21:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,pharaoh is nearly in my grasp After all,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.99,0:21:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,we have the perfect bait
